<Placemark><name>12 → 바벨론 → 애굽 국경(펠루시움)</name><description>캄비세스, 애굽을 정복하다</description><styleUrl>#lE8955F</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>44.42090,32.53640,0 43.81007,32.59707,0 43.20103,32.64348,0 42.59379,32.67564,0 41.98834,32.69355,0 41.38468,32.69722,0 40.78281,32.68663,0 40.18274,32.66178,0 39.58446,32.62269,0 38.98798,32.56935,0 38.39329,32.50175,0 37.80039,32.41991,0 37.20928,32.32381,0 36.61997,32.21346,0 36.03245,32.08887,0 35.44673,31.95002,0 34.86280,31.79691,0 34.28066,31.62956,0 33.70031,31.44796,0 33.12176,31.25211,0 32.54500,31.04200,0</coordinates></LineString><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>32.54500,31.04200,0 32.56823,31.04001,0 32.55991,31.05739,0 32.54500,31.04200,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></MultiGeometry></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>13 → 바벨론 → 베히스툰 비문</name><description>다리오 1세 즉위 · 베히스툰 비문 — 흔들리는 제국</description><styleUrl>#lE8955F</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>44.42090,32.53640,0 44.55051,32.66348,0 44.68234,32.78694,0 44.81640,32.90678,0 44.95269,33.02301,0 45.09120,33.13561,0 45.23193,33.24460,0 45.37489,33.34997,0 45.52007,33.45172,0 45.66748,33.54986,0 45.81712,33.64438,0 45.96897,33.73527,0 46.12306,33.82256,0 46.27937,33.90622,0 46.43790,33.98626,0 46.59866,34.06269,0 46.76164,34.13550,0 46.92685,34.20469,0 47.09429,34.27027,0 47.26395,34.33222,0 47.43583,34.39056,0</coordinates></LineString><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>47.43583,34.39056,0 47.41168,34.39226,0 47.42061,34.37499,0 47.43583,34.39056,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></MultiGeometry></Placemark>
