<Placemark><name>24 → 사마리아 → 수산</name><description>아하수에로(크세르크세스) — 또 고소장</description><styleUrl>#lE0C04F</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>35.19700,32.27600,0 35.84906,32.12275,0 36.50122,31.98518,0 37.15349,31.86328,0 37.80586,31.75706,0 38.45834,31.66651,0 39.11092,31.59163,0 39.76360,31.53242,0 40.41639,31.48889,0 41.06928,31.46103,0 41.72228,31.44884,0 42.37538,31.45233,0 43.02859,31.47149,0 43.68190,31.50632,0 44.33532,31.55683,0 44.98884,31.62301,0 45.64246,31.70486,0 46.29619,31.80238,0 46.95002,31.91558,0 47.60396,32.04445,0 48.25800,32.18900,0</coordinates></LineString><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>48.25800,32.18900,0 48.23508,32.19388,0 48.24040,32.17565,0 48.25800,32.18900,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></MultiGeometry></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>49 → 사마리아 → 수산 → 예루살렘</name><description>성벽 공사를 멈추게 한 편지</description><styleUrl>#lE0C04F</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>35.19700,32.27600,0 35.84906,32.12275,0 36.50122,31.98518,0 37.15349,31.86328,0 37.80586,31.75706,0 38.45834,31.66651,0 39.11092,31.59163,0 39.76360,31.53242,0 40.41639,31.48889,0 41.06928,31.46103,0 41.72228,31.44884,0 42.37538,31.45233,0 43.02859,31.47149,0 43.68190,31.50632,0 44.33532,31.55683,0 44.98884,31.62301,0 45.64246,31.70486,0 46.29619,31.80238,0 46.95002,31.91558,0 47.60396,32.04445,0 48.25800,32.18900,0 47.60219,32.31691,0 46.94686,32.42920,0 46.29204,32.52586,0 45.63770,32.60689,0 44.98386,32.67229,0 44.33051,32.72207,0 43.67765,32.75622,0 43.02529,32.77474,0 42.37342,32.77764,0 41.72205,32.76491,0 41.07116,32.73655,0 40.42077,32.69256,0 39.77087,32.63295,0 39.12147,32.55771,0 38.47256,32.46684,0 37.82414,32.36035,0 37.17622,32.23823,0 36.52878,32.10048,0 35.88185,31.94710,0 35.23540,31.77810,0</coordinates></LineString><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>35.23540,31.77810,0 35.25844,31.77406,0 35.25223,31.79208,0 35.23540,31.77810,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></MultiGeometry></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>67 → 예루살렘 → 수산</name><description>느헤미야, 왕에게 돌아가다</description><styleUrl>#lE0C04F</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>35.23540,31.77810,0 35.88185,31.94710,0 36.52878,32.10048,0 37.17622,32.23823,0 37.82414,32.36035,0 38.47256,32.46684,0 39.12147,32.55771,0 39.77087,32.63295,0 40.42077,32.69256,0 41.07116,32.73655,0 41.72205,32.76491,0 42.37342,32.77764,0 43.02529,32.77474,0 43.67765,32.75622,0 44.33051,32.72207,0 44.98386,32.67229,0 45.63770,32.60689,0 46.29204,32.52586,0 46.94686,32.42920,0 47.60219,32.31691,0 48.25800,32.18900,0</coordinates></LineString><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>48.25800,32.18900,0 48.23995,32.20191,0 48.23526,32.18356,0 48.25800,32.18900,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></MultiGeometry></Placemark>
